'''Stakataka''' (Japanese: '''ツンデツンデ''' ''Tundetunde'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

