==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Stakataka|209}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos|Sun & Moon Black Star Promos}}.
*The '''Brass Rock''' attack is named after [https://jazzrocksoul.com/articles/genres/brass-rock/ brass rock], a genre of music. The name may have been chosen in reference to {{p|Stakataka}}'s {{2t|Rock|Steel}} typing in the [[core series games]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

